## Step 6: Evaluation Against the Truth Set

### Commands


Command to evaluate the gently filtered variant calls against the benchmark truth set and output accuracy metrics.   
```bash
python3 evaluate_snps_v4.py \
  --truth truth_snps.vcf \
  --calls gentle_filtered.vcf.gz \
  --all-samples --tag gentle --outdir gentle_eval_out
```


Command to evaluate the stringently filtered variant calls against the benchmark truth set and output accuracy metrics.   
```
python3 evaluate_snps_v4.py \
  --truth truth_snps.vcf \
  --calls gentle_filtered.vcf.gz \
  --all-samples --tag gentle --outdir stringent_eval_out
```

